{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9a9af118fb070b9ccfffe457dc9d7a315c1a9d15b5a9df721a9412ecc3cf6c4f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:081ffa949b624a633a5d0254777e8739cb9563db1996e933dad98730aa16960a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦啦！\n昨天说的社交平台动态，我刚才看了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:819597981290d227defe9b6bb9ec324add5ab3ac2efd733078cc6309aa029520",
      "text": "大家都有晒出泰迪熊的照片呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7909e7cb92a8a9a0c1b877837db9d7c151af7cc33dbe96c631dbfcf6766c173c",
      "text": "我也把自己拍摄用的泰迪熊用手机拍了下来，\n拿给成员们看了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd330eef316f1b077c397ea0e94fb373a8ebe14dd7420371cf563cee1f0d1673",
      "text": "说起来，好像有不少粉丝也买了同款呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c149d92096d3d25eb7bb7311dc118407bc6430aadae9e25f928cb50996266cd9",
      "text": "这么说来，不就等于和大家用了同款吗？\n哈哈，感觉挺不错的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0295903379b0a909de85095ac4e76acb9302eb543dc17877842d6a912f64a658",
      "text": "虽说不像演唱会那样，能直接跟那么多粉丝见面。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75dd8307e68255952cff4dcdb1e243a393d154194a72accb4e7380ddd7e5e460",
      "text": "但像这样能够共享的回忆，\n也会好好留存下来的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6918aadb3837a455731906be7329964fd17f9a35ebf0f5ec92914228e45decb1",
      "text": "今后也多多\n留下回忆吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa421c1909383eecd43cabcc36121615c2b46d398216f347d92fd6d59cdbd082",
      "text": "一起好好珍惜吧",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:69567a488a44b0398467b6065c0b3dae8aacfd69c9fa0834cdf31c796fe9bb79",
      "text": "是啊！为了让下一份工作也能成为美好回忆，\n得鼓足干劲去挑战才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000028:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14655cf0e26804d2f6a5020c5e573eb989e98f3a0b8c2a8a6c60403d61591542",
      "text": "说得对。\n这只泰迪熊，我也会一直好好珍惜的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000032:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70c0ca87b0b33e45242f157dfc3dae5f80cdfdd391469d51fe6618969cc28699",
      "text": "能看到大家的动态真好啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:023har_403_2_4_023_03_09_a:2_4_023_03_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6a5f68a03092d471bcc9cc67ce6a228169fbfb8e744fd0058d52143a9e7be511",
      "text": "谢谢你告诉我，●●●●プロデューサー。\n那就明天见！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
